---
---
<section class="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="section-head-text">
        <span class="eyebrow">The most common questions</span>
        <h2>What people ask before they book.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <article class="faq-q">
        <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Should I book an appointment?</h3>
          <p>Yes. Booking online is the best way to reserve a chair, especially on weekdays while Joe is usually booked. Walk-ins are accepted when the schedule has room, but calling ahead or booking online helps avoid a wasted trip.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq-q">
        <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Do you take cards?</h3>
          <p>Cash only. There is an ATM on site if you need it. ATM fee is on the machine, not us.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq-q">
        <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>How long does a haircut take?</h3>
          <p>Standard haircut is about 30 minutes. A shave or beard service adds 20–30 minutes on top. Book enough time for the full service, especially if you need a specific window.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq-q">
        <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Do you cut kids' hair?</h3>
          <p>Yes. Family-friendly shop. Kids cuts are the same price as adult cuts — $30. Bring the whole family.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq-q">
        <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Where are you located?</h3>
          <p>723 E Bradley Ave, Suite C, El Cajon CA 92021 — Bostonia neighborhood, strip mall on Bradley Avenue. Easy parking in the lot out front.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .faq { background: var(--surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .faq-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; max-width: 980px; }
  .faq-q { padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  .faq-q .num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1; }
  .faq-q h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 28px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.005em; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .faq-q p { margin: 0; font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg); max-width: 70ch; }
</style>
